  "manifest": {
    "name": "dsh-cindy-host",
    "version": "0.1.31",
    "private": false,
    "description": "Cindy 手机客户端连接 DSH 的 Host 侧插件：会话/消息/审批/todo/goal 的手机通道，以及配套的设置卡片",
    "license": "MIT",
    "repository": {
      "type": "git",
      "url": "git+https://github.com/chanyuenpang/dsh-cindy-host.git"
    },
    "keywords": [
      "dsh",
      "dsh-plugin",
      "cordis",
      "cindy",
      "device-link"
    ],
    "engines": {
      "node": ">=22.16.0"
    },
    "//files": "白名单，而非整个目录：.sandbox/（含凭据与会话）、.claw/runtime、验收日志、开发记录都不进包。见 doc/publishing.md §3。",
    "files": [
      "src",
      "lib",
      "cordis.patch.yml",
      "README.md",
      "CHANGELOG.md",
      "LICENSE"
    ],
    "type": "module",
    "main": "./src/dsh-plugin.js",
    "exports": {
      ".": "./src/dsh-plugin.js",
      "./client": "./lib/client.js",
      "./src/*": "./src/*",
      "./package.json": "./package.json"
    },
    "dsh": {
      "bundle": {
        "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
      },
      "client": {
        "platform": "web"
      }
    },
    "scripts": {
      "acceptance": "node tools/acceptance.mjs",
      "acceptance:sandbox": "node tools/acceptance.mjs --base http://127.0.0.1:3081",
      "sandbox": "node tools/sandbox.mjs start",
      "sandbox:stop": "node tools/sandbox.mjs stop",
      "restart": "node tools/restart-host.mjs",
      "restart:apply": "node tools/restart-host.mjs --apply",
      "audit:channels": "node tools/channel-audit.mjs",
      "verify": "npm test && npm run audit:channels && npm run acceptance",
      "demo": "node src/demo.js",
      "login": "node src/login.js",
      "logout": "node src/logout.js",
      "host": "node src/host.js",
      "host:demo": "node src/host-demo.js",
      "test": "node --test",
      "test:file-peer": "node --test test/file-peer-rtc.test.js test/host-file-peer.test.js test/host-file-ice.test.js test/host-media-fetch.test.js test/file-peer-integration.test.js",
      "smoke:file-peer": "node tools/file-peer-rtc-smoke.mjs --manager"
    },
    "//dependencies": "只放宿主不提供的库。DSH 自己的包一律不进 dependencies —— 见下面 peerDependencies 的说明。`keytar` 放 optionalDependencies：它是**原生**模块，没有 C++ 工具链的机器上必然编译失败，而 pnpm 会把普通 dependency 的构建失败当成安装失败（exit 1）—— DSH 随后就不会把这个 bundle 写进 `dsh.profile.bundles`，行也就永远不会出现。可选依赖的构建失败是允许的，与我们本来就有的惰性 require + 降级（凭据能力不可用，插件照常 mount）语义一致。",
    "dependencies": {
      "werift": "0.24.4",
      "ws": "^8.21.3"
    },
    "optionalDependencies": {
      "keytar": "^7.9.0"
    },
    "//peerDependencies": "DSH 自己的包必须由宿主提供，绝不能声明成 dependency/optionalDependency：pnpm 会把它们**连同整代依赖图**装进 profile，宿主再组合这个混合体就起不来（实测：`^0.1.1-rc.2` 会把 28 个 0.1.1-rc.2 的包装进一个 0.1.5-rc.2 的宿主，profile 启动失败于 dsh-client-file-upload / dsh-session）。区间必须覆盖宿主那一代（semver 的预发布规则：`^0.1.1-rc.2` 匹配不到 `0.1.5-rc.2`），与生态里 dsh-codex / dsh-cost-meter 的写法一致；`0.2.0-rc.2` 需要 `>=0.2.0-rc.1 <0.3.0-0`。",
    "peerDependencies": {
      "@deepseek-ai/dsh-session": "0.2.1-rc.3 || 0.2.1-rc.4 || 0.2.1-rc.5",
      "@deepseek-ai/dsh-settings": "0.2.1-rc.3 || 0.2.1-rc.4 || 0.2.1-rc.5",
      "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": "^3.18.1"
    },
    "//peerDependenciesMeta": "**故意没有这个字段。** `@deepseek-ai/dsh-host-apiproxy` 曾经在这里标 optional，但 0.2 已经删掉了这个包，而 `evaluatePluginCompatibility` 会遍历 `peerDependencies` 的**每一个键且不查 `peerDependenciesMeta`**，所以只要它出现在 peers 里，`dsh plugin add` 就会直接拒绝安装（`installation rejected`），启动时 bundle 也会被静默跳过、`dsh-cindy-host` 行根本不会出现。该适配器本来就走惰性 `require` + 失败降级（见 src/dsh-plugin.js 的 apiProxy 分支），从 peers 里移除不改变任何运行时行为，只是让两道门禁都能正确判定。",
    "devDependencies": {
      "react": "^18.3.1",
      "react-dom": "^18.3.1"
    }
  },
  "bundle": [
    {
      "path": "cordis.patch.yml",
      "text": "# Host-plane bundle. The legacy apiProxy adapter is optional: current DSH Web\n# profiles expose Typert remotes instead, so this row must mount without it.\n- insert:\n    - id: dsh-cindy-host\n      name: dsh-cindy-host\n      inject: [settings]\n"
    }
  ],
